b-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"217fedbbdee0f4bfd54fe5d239999c59da0a567e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rosbag2/commits/217fedbbdee0f4bfd54fe5d239999c59da0a567e","html_url":"https://github.com/ros2/rosbag2/commit/217fedbbdee0f4bfd54fe5d239999c59da0a567e"}]},{"sha":"217fedbbdee0f4bfd54fe5d239999c59da0a567e","node_id":"C_kwDOB5aMANoAKDIxN2ZlZGJiZGVlMGY0YmZkNTRmZTVkMjM5OTk5YzU5ZGEwYTU2N2U","commit":{"author":{"name":"Michael Carroll","email":"mjcarroll.oss@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-06T17:02:49Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-10-06T17:02:49Z"},"message":"Build rosbag2_performance_benchmarking with /bigobj on MSVC (#2494)\n\nbenchmark_publishers.cpp instantiates rclcpp::Publisher<T>, and the\nwhole type support stack behind it, for every message type handled by\nmsg_utils::create() -- 25 of them -- in a single translation unit.\n\nMeasured COMDAT section counts for benchmark_publishers.cpp.obj\n(MSVC 19.51, x64), against the 65,535 limit of the default object file\nformat:\n\n  Release          51,494   (79% of the limit)\n  RelWithDebInfo   70,162   (107%)\n  Debug            91,482   (140%)\n\nSo the TU has been sitting just under the ceiling in Release for a\nwhile, and goes over it as soon as debug info is enabled. This has\nbroken packaging_windows, which builds RelWithDebInfo, on every run\nsince build 4098:\n\n  fatal error C1128: number of sections exceeded object file format\n  limit: compile with /bigobj\n\nSplitting the factory into its own translation unit does not help: on\nits own it still needs 68,258 sections, over the limit by itself.\n/bigobj raises the ceiling to 2^31 sections and costs nothing else.\n\nSigned-off-by: Michael Carroll <mjcarroll.oss@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"1652f2f02e01cb8c4477e06a4a131975f811b212","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rosbag2/git/trees/1652f2f02e01cb8c4477e06a4a131975f811b212"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rosbag2/git/commits/217fedbbdee0f4bfd54fe5d239999c59da0a567e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxSm5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgXgQACE95QEqlo88Aqp5d1KEeUn4\nOoan2cYp+0dtS4waKrK3R45HbXVAEwV54A6UL/GQjMpAZzWMq+2/47vIWz/O70sT\n4mGbLKmlUMSRVRCPmTjb8n9xUOTaeRj4l3749Pmu/Lk110L9yJ3JbjgjldErA6Fl\n12YgzT0utUo3ysA6/PggrALACl/k4cw+z6h30qD7MBXbDE/0NtAsGEjUs8MxZvt2\nzLyTTuOmbYm29hGNMrUn45zDUnw2aiNwaOs34s9uExAk7PNPqSVSE3xOtEoHkSOq\n8gh6V2CBDBLKhoCVzPyeJ/gXFsrVFUKVYxakqplrHWxAaGe9YiXQa/oHx2/Qzl+/\ns1ye8xR+a2zepqBabmZIZ+dLU9gs2qRDOkmMFRtwRev/aaR/IFJM/I58Ilcqqs/i\nH6xk+OxldAeDrm/FBLCSoJZsoCcNWWA9evqSBdOmTZ3YvdMNR1PcKKFHfg02WLFR\nIFDT8vXtVCiC9l9lYOabUTAH0MufF9LQKlsIE/WCXQZ7rm2af3yqkI/dTg3PNhmc\no6Rug0Ii66+4QtGDaonR41BYPX5VAZWQdjdQSIcZ/owteG9lreCxqTwxlcpG3BeZ\nCHi6yEbFr238qyo06swSgR3g0kxiIiU8QOWokrRqnMHFyW1Vvcr9sKsUwkb2MKpD\n8Wnuc0m46VFW1P8F1c6M\n=PqoG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 1652f2f02e01cb8c4477e06a4a131975f811b212\nparent ca049f3827f0e4f5cf9657ac8df8efe0ebf81855\nauthor Michael Carroll <mjcarroll.oss@gmail.com> 1791306169 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791306169 -0700\n\nBuild rosbag2_performance_benchmarking with /bigobj on MSVC (#2494)\n\nbenchmark_publishers.cpp instantiates rclcpp::Publisher<T>, and the\nwhole type support stack behind it, for every message type handled by\nmsg_utils::create() -- 25 of them -- in a single translation unit.\n\nMeasured COMDAT section counts for benchmark_publishers.cpp.obj\n(MSVC 19.51, x64), against the 65,535 limit of the default object file\nformat:\n\n  Release          51,494   (79% of the limit)\n  RelWithDebInfo   70,162   (107%)\n  Debug            91,482   (140%)\n\nSo the TU has been sitting just under the ceiling in Release for a\nwhile, and goes over it as soon as debug info is enabled. This has\nbroken packaging_windows, which builds RelWithDebInfo, on every run\nsince build 4098:\n\n  fatal error C1128: number of sections exceeded object file format\n  limit: compile with /bigobj\n\nSplitting the factory into its own translation unit does not help: on\nits own it still needs 68,258 sections, over the limit by itself.\n/bigobj raises the ceiling to 2^31 sections and costs nothing else.\n\nSigned-off-by: Michael Carroll <mjcarroll.oss@gmail.com>","verified_at":"2026-10-06T17:02:50Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rosbag2/commits/217fedbbdee0f4bfd54fe5d239999c59da0a567e","html_url":"https://github.com/ros2/rosbag2/commit/217fedbbdee0f4bfd54fe5d239999c59da0a567e","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rosbag2/commits/217fedbbdee0f4bfd54fe5d239999c59da0a567e/comments","author":{"login":"mjcarroll","id":279701,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3OTcwMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/279701?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjcarroll","html_url":"https://github.com/mjcarroll","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjcarroll/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjcarroll/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjcarroll/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjcarroll/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjcarroll/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjcarroll/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjcarroll/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjcarroll/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjcarroll/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","fol