"https://api.github.com/users/MiguelCompany/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MiguelCompany/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MiguelCompany/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"454c68d40278cf21e1a5ec36ce27ae5abdc61e57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rosbag2/commits/454c68d40278cf21e1a5ec36ce27ae5abdc61e57","html_url":"https://github.com/ros2/rosbag2/commit/454c68d40278cf21e1a5ec36ce27ae5abdc61e57"}]},{"sha":"454c68d40278cf21e1a5ec36ce27ae5abdc61e57","node_id":"C_kwDOB5aMANoAKDQ1NGM2OGQ0MDI3OGNmMjFlMWE1ZWMzNmNlMjdhZTVhYmRjNjFlNTc","commit":{"author":{"name":"Tomoya Fujita","email":"fujita.tomoya@triorb.co.jp","date":"2026-10-06T15:27:12Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-10-06T15:27:12Z"},"message":"Fix GCC 15 -Warray-bounds false positive in test_rewrite (#2521)\n\nmake_fake_protobuf_payload(), added in #2476, builds the payload by\nconstructing a vector from an 8 byte initializer list and then inserting\n16 more bytes with the fill overload of vector::insert. With GCC 15 at\n-O3 (the default Release flags) the inlined fill path triggers a bogus\nwarning:\n\n  stl_uninitialized.h:553:39: warning: 'void* __builtin_memset(...)'\n  offset [8, 23] is out of the bounds [0, 8] [-Warray-bounds=]\n\nGCC cannot prove that the no-reallocation branch of _M_fill_insert is\ndead for the original 8 byte buffer, so it reports a write past that\nbuffer even though the real execution always reallocates first.\n\nReserve the final size up front so the compiler sees a buffer that is\nlarge enough for every subsequent insert. The payload bytes are\nunchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: Tomoya Fujita <fujita.tomoya@triorb.co.jp>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6124fbd2705e4e35c707d282f8d5fefed120e27d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rosbag2/git/trees/6124fbd2705e4e35c707d282f8d5fefed120e27d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rosbag2/git/commits/454c68d40278cf21e1a5ec36ce27ae5abdc61e57","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxRNQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAM4kQAAepd1cfcKPk/iqf2t9SQgcI\nrQlphKxXh3FiDomwRl5MPZ+eKChW3n8aTTs+y0IzOkA5SmYcjdWI612DyPfPv4WV\nQXIuxaRURwG1vmDP45Otnf1atsJ+1h9sF2kFdzBD+OdG7T1X6PaFwEqmfH3b9bKW\nYkGJHlJKdXmLdhDFQ4XrppeHowop75/Bs8mLhkw4WpEvBtaJc+Kn96dv3rnyXgeA\nYGX7K6PJOwa4URBoClmMPduoGyGSQ5VdbjyZXy7pTYcb6ihLEngktsADvPlq7egh\nlD7HDER5in2iEpQF0mLDcYPMN9FEopNlkfIX/PPd7J46nqhebLPS2Ngfx3yxAwX0\nQkuao+OmVcrv1Li+ZH26rQivM5DoJuJxEdzibn1MzBRnpPIU1CRnN7bVKTGJz/GZ\n5lA+VioIn8Fyr/HBkf5JlaGdCiZG5dP1FtOLfcBx5HSAK3+GiKjbQVFmNpq0DezQ\nWP2pD7D97p/B04ydoJXH/BVNxatrhUG8bnXZzb35PJQ7XwGXhA1DfOjwk7rTLtxA\nau0hfL0Evp0eMaRThK4aVMIJbCPEHblrYaU7A45W6dxOiay5DMgR/hS07SOuJVsw\nUpIiyVpfqUdUKQ1rsmBnVv/ClyjC3AhIMUANKASGmsRfvH5VEMKRomteItpngEAC\nigsTH1aD/4p2gqnxLZWn\n=p4aR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 6124fbd2705e4e35c707d282f8d5fefed120e27d\nparent e6803915796bae3a37cf836df1abb31440fb8cd3\nauthor Tomoya Fujita <fujita.tomoya@triorb.co.jp> 1791300432 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791300432 +0200\n\nFix GCC 15 -Warray-bounds false positive in test_rewrite (#2521)\n\nmake_fake_protobuf_payload(), added in #2476, builds the payload by\nconstructing a vector from an 8 byte initializer list and then inserting\n16 more bytes with the fill overload of vector::insert. With GCC 15 at\n-O3 (the default Release flags) the inlined fill path triggers a bogus\nwarning:\n\n  stl_uninitialized.h:553:39: warning: 'void* __builtin_memset(...)'\n  offset [8, 23] is out of the bounds [0, 8] [-Warray-bounds=]\n\nGCC cannot prove that the no-reallocation branch of _M_fill_insert is\ndead for the original 8 byte buffer, so it reports a write past that\nbuffer even though the real execution always reallocates first.\n\nReserve the final size up front so the compiler sees a buffer that is\nlarge enough for every subsequent insert. The payload bytes are\nunchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: Tomoya Fujita <fujita.tomoya@triorb.co.jp>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","verified_at":"2026-10-06T15:27:13Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rosbag2/commits/454c68d40278cf21e1a5ec36ce27ae5abdc61e57","html_url":"https://github.com/ros2/rosbag2/commit/454c68d40278cf21e1a5ec36ce27ae5abdc61e57","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/rosbag2/commits/454c68d40278cf21e1a5ec36ce27ae5abdc61e57/comments","author":{"login":"fujitatomoya","id":43395114,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMzk1MTE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43395114?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujitatomoya","html_url":"https://github.com/fujitatomoya","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujitatomoya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujitatomoya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujitatomoya/gists{/gist_id}","st